Lumo Desktop for Linux — unofficial builds
==========================================

This repository is a fork of Proton's Lumo Desktop source
(https://github.com/ProtonLumo/lumo-desktop) that adds unofficial Linux
packaging: an Arch package, an AppImage, and a pacman repository.

  Upstream project : https://github.com/ProtonLumo/lumo-desktop
  Copyright        : Proton AG and contributors
  Licence          : GNU General Public License v3.0 only (GPL-3.0-only).
                     The full text is the LICENSE file in this repository.

The packages built here are compiled from the upstream source at the commit
recorded in each package recipe. **No source modifications are applied** —
the only additions are packaging metadata (desktop entry, icons, this
notice) and the build recipes under packaging/.

